{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00575","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享先蚕乐章 展敬 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 享先蚕乐章 展敬","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"霞庄列宝卫，云集动和声。\n金卮荐绮席，玉币委芳庭。\n因心罄丹款，先己励苍生。\n所冀延明福，於兹享至诚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00575.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00575","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}